{"version":1,"content":"<p>出道時已明言視紅館為目標的「樂壇小天后」炎明熹（Gigi），得悉亦師亦友的鍾嘉欣宣布舉行紅館個唱時，第一時間留言恭喜。</p><p>近日積極宣傳新派台歌的Gigi，在社交網分享邊彈結他邊唱新歌《在搖搖板上相對的我們》的短片，由於素顏、亂髮半遮面，加上拍攝</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:44.733800+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T16:01:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.632999+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.632999+00:00","content_hash":"4959270c19a72ce047ca77a54babba506d9b31fd48127511a3edb85a602e0ac8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}